# Published data snapshots. Previously gitignored wholesale as the *only*
# safety mechanism against committing unreviewed data — that job now belongs
# to the CLI gate instead (`council publish` refuses to run without
# --from-draft + --confirm; see src/publish_gate.py and docs/TESTING.md).
# This directory is meant to hold real, reviewed, public data, so it's
# tracked like any other part of the site. It currently holds only
# structurally-valid placeholder data (scripts/generate_placeholder_data.py)
# — no real council data is committed here until a draft has actually
# cleared the gate.

# WA LGA boundary geojson (fetched via scripts/download_wa_lga.sh) — not
# council-analysis data, just a large (7MB+) static map fixture. Kept out of
# git to keep pushes small; MapPage.tsx already falls back to a "run the
# download script" message when it's missing locally.
public/data/wa_lga.geojson
*.local

